<title>USA: Mansur shares start trading on Nasdaq.</title>
<headline>Mansur shares start trading on Nasdaq.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mansur Industries Inc said its shares began trading on Nasdaq Friday after the Securities and Exchange Commission declared its registration statement for an initial public offering effective two days ago.</p>
<p>The offering was for one million common shares priced at $7.50 per share, the recycling industrial parts washer manufacturer said in a statement.</p>
<p>Shares were being sold through First Allied Securities Inc.</p>
<p>--New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
